[{"text": "The assembly", "start": 3.679, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "will hear an address by His Excellency", "start": 5.52, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Madi Dumbia,", "start": 8.96, "duration": 8.04}, {"text": "President of the Republic of Guinea.", "start": 12.08, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "I request protocol to accept to escort", "start": 17.6, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "his excellency and invite him to address", "start": 20.64, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "the assembly.", "start": 23.439, "duration": 3.241}, {"text": "M", "start": 40.559, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": ">> Mr. President of the 81st session of the", "start": 42.16, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "General Assembly of the United Nations,", "start": 47.28, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General of the United", "start": 50.239, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Nations.", "start": 54.48, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 56.079, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen, heads of state and", "start": 57.68, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "government.", "start": 60.239, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 62.16, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen, heads of", "start": 63.92, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "delegation,", "start": 66.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 68.4, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 71.76, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "at the outset,", "start": 74.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "I wish to convey to you on behalf of the", "start": 76.159, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "sovereign peoples of the Republic of", "start": 80.0, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Guinea and our delegation", "start": 82.159, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "our warmest congratulations upon your", "start": 85.759, "duration": 9.121}, {"text": "election to the presidency of this 81st", "start": 88.32, "duration": 10.08}, {"text": "session of the General Assembly of the", "start": 94.88, "duration": 8.879}, {"text": "United Nations. I cherish the hope that", "start": 98.4, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "our proceedings under your skillful", "start": 103.759, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "stewardship will allow the United", "start": 106.159, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "Nations, our organization,", "start": 108.24, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "to best address and meet the legitimate", "start": 111.04, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "aspirations of the peoples of the world.", "start": 114.72, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "I also wish to applaud the continuous", "start": 118.079, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "and consistent efforts of the Secretary", "start": 123.36, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "General, Mr. Antonio Guterish", "start": 125.68, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "at the helm of our United Nations. It is", "start": 128.399, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "with a profound", "start": 133.52, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "feeling of pride", "start": 135.68, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "and of humility", "start": 138.239, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "that I speak before this august body on", "start": 140.48, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "behalf of the sovereign people of the", "start": 144.4, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Republic of Guinea", "start": 145.92, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "as we seek to", "start": 148.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "describe to the international community", "start": 151.52, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "the progress that my country has", "start": 154.0, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "achieved. Ladies and gentlemen, three", "start": 157.36, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "years ago from this rostrm,", "start": 161.28, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "I", "start": 165.36, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "with", "start": 166.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "the cander that my country and our", "start": 168.879, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "continent", "start": 171.68, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "are bound by,", "start": 173.44, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "I spoke the truth", "start": 175.84, "duration": 6.759}, {"text": "and I stated", "start": 178.879, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "that the", "start": 183.92, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "model of imported governance", "start": 186.4, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "without being adapted on our continent", "start": 189.12, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "was not generating the fruits that had", "start": 192.8, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "been expected by our peoples and this is", "start": 196.8, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "something which I stand by. But today I", "start": 200.8, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "am once again speaking before you with a", "start": 205.2, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "different mindset.", "start": 208.0, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "I do not seek to denounce", "start": 211.519, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "but rather to share with you", "start": 214.0, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "to share with you", "start": 217.28, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "factual elements", "start": 219.76, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "about the progress and the headway that", "start": 223.2, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "has been made by the Republic of Guinea", "start": 226.319, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "as we have", "start": 228.959, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "achieved results", "start": 232.08, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "that have emanated from the choices that", "start": 235.28, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "we have made.", "start": 238.159, "duration": 3.481}, {"text": "On the basis of our constitution, the", "start": 245.68, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "Republic of Guinea organized an entire", "start": 249.439, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "direct presidential or legislative", "start": 253.439, "duration": 3.441}, {"text": "communal", "start": 255.28, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "elections and we've established all", "start": 256.88, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "institutions", "start": 260.16, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "which", "start": 262.72, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "are entirely financed by our treasury.", "start": 264.56, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "And", "start": 273.36, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "I state this with a rightful", "start": 277.36, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "sense of pride that", "start": 281.28, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "none of these elections that were held", "start": 286.08, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "throughout our territory, none of these", "start": 288.16, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "elections were marred by any significant", "start": 289.84, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "incidents on the part of any of the", "start": 292.56, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "participants in this electoral process.", "start": 295.04, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "And this reflects the fact ladies and", "start": 296.8, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "gentlemen that a country can organize", "start": 299.12, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "independently using its own resources", "start": 304.0, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "credible, peaceful and transparent", "start": 306.56, "duration": 6.199}, {"text": "elections.", "start": 309.759, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "This constitution", "start": 314.56, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "that we've adopted introduces", "start": 316.96, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "profound innovations in terms of", "start": 319.6, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "peaceful coexistence as well as greater", "start": 322.16, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "uh representation of our localities in", "start": 325.28, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "our communities as well as novel", "start": 328.32, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "guarantees for peaceful transfer of", "start": 330.479, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "power", "start": 332.8, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "and includes recognition", "start": 335.199, "duration": 5.081}, {"text": "of our cultural, linguistic, religious", "start": 340.32, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "and cultural plurality as the bedrock of", "start": 344.0, "duration": 11.4}, {"text": "our nation and not as a divisive factor.", "start": 348.4, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "And", "start": 362.88, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "this I state with a sense of legitimate", "start": 364.8, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "pride. All of these elections were", "start": 368.4, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "organized on our soil once again without", "start": 371.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "any assistance from any party", "start": 375.12, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "whatsoever.", "start": 377.36, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 378.96, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "I have not I did not come here to", "start": 383.68, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "exercise in rhetoric, but I do believe", "start": 389.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "it is worthwhile to share with you to", "start": 391.039, "duration": 7.641}, {"text": "share a simple overview", "start": 394.24, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "and a useful", "start": 399.6, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "useful information about what our", "start": 402.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "the Republic of Guinea has achieved in", "start": 405.52, "duration": 6.119}, {"text": "less than three years.", "start": 407.6, "duration": 4.039}, {"text": "We have uh", "start": 411.84, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "paved more than a thousand kilometers of", "start": 414.479, "duration": 7.801}, {"text": "roads which have connected our regions.", "start": 417.12, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "We have the Simandu mega project which", "start": 422.88, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "is", "start": 425.919, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "Africa's largest mining and", "start": 427.52, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "infrastructure project which is", "start": 429.52, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "currently complete.", "start": 430.96, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "We have schools and hospitals that have", "start": 436.08, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "been built throughout all of the", "start": 438.639, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Republic of Guinea.", "start": 441.28, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Three aluminum refineries which are", "start": 443.759, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "under construction as we seek to", "start": 446.8, "duration": 8.119}, {"text": "transform our box site on our own soil.", "start": 448.56, "duration": 6.359}, {"text": "We have uh Africa's largest gold", "start": 456.08, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "refinery which is currently operational", "start": 459.759, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "and this has already been completed and", "start": 462.16, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "we have a sustainable and responsible", "start": 464.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "socioeconomic development program for my", "start": 468.08, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "country for the next 15 years that I", "start": 470.72, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "refer to the seamandu 2040 project.", "start": 474.479, "duration": 10.0}, {"text": "The Simandu 20 240 program embodies", "start": 479.039, "duration": 9.761}, {"text": "a trans structural transformation", "start": 484.479, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "initiative for our economy. This is not", "start": 488.8, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "merely a mining project. This represents", "start": 490.8, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "a meaningful strategic lever in order to", "start": 493.28, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "accelerate the development of", "start": 496.96, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "infrastructure as well as agriculture,", "start": 498.479, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "energy, education,", "start": 501.12, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "health.", "start": 503.84, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Not to mention these are just a few and", "start": 505.759, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "these are results that we have achieved", "start": 509.199, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "in less than three months and I'm not", "start": 511.199, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "mentioning them merely out of a sense of", "start": 512.719, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "hope.", "start": 515.279, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "They reflect a conviction which I wish", "start": 517.44, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "to share with this general assembly.", "start": 519.76, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "Our most valuable asset remains our", "start": 523.839, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "youth and we must provide them with a", "start": 528.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "high quality education with training", "start": 531.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "opportunities reflected to meet the", "start": 534.88, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "needs of the labor market through the", "start": 537.76, "duration": 9.4}, {"text": "Simandu economy academy initiative", "start": 541.839, "duration": 5.321}, {"text": "as well as meaningful opportunities for", "start": 547.76, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "employment and entrepreneur. reneurship.", "start": 551.839, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 555.279, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "heads of state and government,", "start": 557.68, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "our recent experience permits me", "start": 561.12, "duration": 8.719}, {"text": "respectfully to state assert", "start": 564.399, "duration": 9.681}, {"text": "when governance models are", "start": 569.839, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "tailored to reflect the historical,", "start": 574.08, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "social, and cultural realities of each", "start": 576.64, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "nation rather than halfhazardly being", "start": 578.56, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "imposed. That is when development", "start": 582.24, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "accelerates.", "start": 584.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Let us consider Asia.", "start": 586.56, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "Let us consider certain nations in the", "start": 589.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Middle East. They did not wait for an", "start": 592.959, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "external model to be endorsed in order", "start": 596.56, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "to become prosperous. They drew", "start": 599.92, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "inspiration", "start": 603.519, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "from the universal experience", "start": 605.2, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "uh while at the same time tailoring that", "start": 608.56, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "to their national brilliance.", "start": 612.32, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "In one generation they managed to", "start": 616.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "achieve what others spent a century", "start": 618.64, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "attaining.", "start": 621.68, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "Africa too can embark upon this path.", "start": 623.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "This is not reflective of a rejection of", "start": 627.839, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "the world nor rejection of international", "start": 630.32, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "cooperation. Quite to the contrary, this", "start": 632.88, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "is a call for win-win partnership.", "start": 635.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "Partnership that is respectful of the", "start": 639.279, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "sovereignty of each nation", "start": 641.2, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "rooted in", "start": 644.8, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "winwin", "start": 647.44, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "collaboration", "start": 649.12, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "rather than pre-established arrangements", "start": 650.8, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "which disregard our realities. The", "start": 653.92, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "Republic of Guinea for our part is and", "start": 657.279, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "shall remain", "start": 661.839, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "a reliable,", "start": 663.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "open, engaged partner open, reliable and", "start": 665.6, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "and engaged visa v the international", "start": 669.76, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "community", "start": 672.0, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "while engaging in mutual respect for the", "start": 674.24, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "sovereignty of one and all. Mr.", "start": 678.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "President, excellencies, ladies and", "start": 682.32, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "gentlemen,", "start": 683.92, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "the Republic of Guinea is advancing. We", "start": 686.16, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "are making headway by harnessing our own", "start": 690.88, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "means, by capitalizing upon our own", "start": 694.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "choices for the benefit of our own", "start": 697.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "people. And we are doing so in a manner", "start": 699.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "that is in accordance with international", "start": 702.959, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "law in the with the spirit of the", "start": 704.8, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "charter of the United Nations and in a", "start": 706.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "spirit of candid and inclusive", "start": 709.04, "duration": 8.84}, {"text": "cooperation with all of our partners.", "start": 711.68, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "I cherish the hope that this Ginan", "start": 718.0, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "experience", "start": 722.64, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "can to a modest degree stimulate more", "start": 725.2, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "in-depth consideration", "start": 729.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "into the manifold legitimate development", "start": 731.76, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "pathways for our continent. Thank you", "start": 734.72, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "for your attention.", "start": 736.8, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly,", "start": 751.92, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "I wish to thank the president of the", "start": 755.44, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "Republic of Guinea.", "start": 757.839, "duration": 4.281}]